*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Molecule: H2
* Basis: STO-3G
* Symmetry: C1
* Features tested: Checking the WRITEGRID option.
* Responsible person: Bhavnesh Jangid (University of Chicago)
* Comments: This test will verify the the written gridfile is nonempty and 
*           have four-column grid.
*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

>> EXPORT MOLCAS_NOCHECK=SEWARD,SCF_ITER,E_SCF,DFT_ENERGY,NQ_DENSITY,MLTPL

&GATEWAY
  coord = 2
    bohr
  H  0.0  0.0 -0.7
  H  0.0  0.0  0.7
  basis = STO-3G
  group = NoSymm

&SEWARD
  grid input
    grid
      coarse
    writegrid
  end of grid

&SCF
  ksdft = LDA

* Confirm that WRITEGRID produced data and that every record contains
* x, y, z, and a positive quadrature weight.
>> SHELL test -s $WorkDir/$Project.GridFile
>> SHELL awk 'NF != 4 || $4 <= 0 { bad=1 } END { exit (bad || NR == 0) }' $WorkDir/$Project.GridFile

